<%= @days_until == 1 ? "See You Tomorrow!" : "Event Reminder" %>

Hi <%= @tickets.first.attendee_name %>,

<%= @event.title %> is coming up <%= @days_until == 1 ? 'tomorrow' : "in #{@days_until} days" %>.

EVENT DETAILS
-------------
Event: <%= @event.title %>
Date: <%= @event.start_date.strftime("%B %d, %Y") %>
<% if @event.event_locations.any? %>
Venue: <%= @event.event_locations.first.name %>
<% end %>
<% ticket_types_uniform = @tickets.map(&:ticket_type_id).uniq.one? %>
<% if ticket_types_uniform %>Ticket Type: <%= @tickets.first.ticket_type.name %>
<% end %>

YOUR TICKETS (<%= @tickets.size %>)
<% @tickets.each_with_index do |ticket, index| %>
<%= index + 1 %>. <%= ticket.attendee_name %><% unless ticket_types_uniform %> (<%= ticket.ticket_type.name %>)<% end %> — Ticket ID: <%= ticket.public_id %>
<% end %>

QR codes are attached to this email, one per attendee. Have these ready for check-in. We look forward to seeing you!

---
This email was sent by EventzFlow
